# Text files are LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every OS. .editorconfig asks for LF, and
# `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` would otherwise fail on a Windows checkout that converted to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.mid binary
*.sf2 binary
*.woff2 binary
